## Original Content
Le conflit au Soudan déborde de nouveau au Tchad. L'armée tchadienne affirme que des aéronefs et des drones liés aux belligérants soudanais ont poursuivi et bombardé une colonne de véhicules jusque sur le territoire tchadien. La correspondance à Ndjamena de Ghislaine Allahtaroum.

## Summary
The conflict in Sudan has spilled over into Chad, with the Chadian army alleging that aircraft and drones linked to Sudanese combatants pursued and bombarded a vehicle column on Chadian territory. This incident is described as a new violation of territorial integrity, highlighting regional security concerns.

## Key Points
- The conflict in Sudan is escalating and affecting neighboring Chad.
- The Chadian army claims that aircraft and drones associated with Sudanese belligerents entered Chadian airspace and territory.
- A vehicle column was pursued and bombarded on Chadian soil, indicating a direct military breach.
- The event is characterized as a new 'violation of the territory' by the Chadian military, underscoring ongoing tensions.


